<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Verify Your HashCart Seller Account</title>
  </head>

  <body
    style="
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #0f172a;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #1e293b;
    "
  >
    <table
      width="100%"
      cellpadding="0"
      cellspacing="0"
      border="0"
      style="background-color: #0f172a; padding: 45px 15px"
    >
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <!-- Main Container -->
          <table
            width="100%"
            cellpadding="0"
            cellspacing="0"
            border="0"
            style="
              max-width: 580px;
              background-color: #ffffff;
              border-radius: 16px;
              overflow: hidden;
              box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
            "
          >
            <!-- Header -->
            <tr>
              <td
                align="center"
                style="
                  padding: 35px 30px 30px;
                  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%);
                  border-bottom: 3px solid #2563eb;
                "
              >
                <!-- Brand Badge -->
                <div style="margin-bottom: 12px">
                  <span
                    style="
                      display: inline-block;
                      background-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);
                      color: #60a5fa;
                      font-size: 11px;
                      font-weight: 700;
                      text-transform: uppercase;
                      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
                      padding: 5px 14px;
                      border-radius: 20px;
                      border: 1px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.3);
                    "
                  >
                    Seller Portal
                  </span>
                </div>

                <div
                  style="
                    font-size: 30px;
                    font-weight: 800;
                    color: #ffffff;
                    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
                  "
                >
                  Hash<span style="color: #3b82f6">Cart</span>
                </div>

                <div style="margin-top: 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8">
                  Partner with us • Grow your business globally
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Content Area -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 40px 40px 35px">
                <h1
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 16px;
                    font-size: 24px;
                    line-height: 32px;
                    color: #0f172a;
                    font-weight: 700;
                  "
                >
                  Verify your seller registration 🛍️
                </h1>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 18px;
                    font-size: 15px;
                    line-height: 24px;
                    color: #475569;
                  "
                >
                  Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 25px;
                    font-size: 15px;
                    line-height: 24px;
                    color: #475569;
                  "
                >
                  Welcome to the <strong>HashCart Merchant Network</strong>. We're excited to help you launch and grow your online store. To complete your seller registration and secure your storefront, please enter the one-time verification code below:
                </p>

                <!-- OTP Display Box -->
                <table
                  width="100%"
                  cellpadding="0"
                  cellspacing="0"
                  border="0"
                  style="margin: 30px 0"
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td
                      align="center"
                      style="
                        background-color: #f8fafc;
                        border: 2px dashed #cbd5e1;
                        border-radius: 12px;
                        padding: 24px 20px;
                      "
                    >
                      <div
                        style="
                          font-size: 12px;
                          font-weight: 700;
                          color: #64748b;
                          text-transform: uppercase;
                          letter-spacing: 1.5px;
                          margin-bottom: 8px;
                        "
                      >
                        Your Seller Verification Code
                      </div>
                      <div
                        style="
                          font-size: 38px;
                          font-weight: 800;
                          letter-spacing: 10px;
                          color: #1e3a8a;
                          font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
                        "
                      >
                        <%= otp %>
                      </div>
                      <div
                        style="
                          margin-top: 10px;
                          font-size: 12px;
                          color: #94a3b8;
                        "
                      >
                        ⏳ Valid for the next <strong>5 minutes</strong>
                      </div>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <!-- Next Steps Info Card -->
                <div
                  style="
                    background-color: #eff6ff;
                    border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
                    padding: 16px 18px;
                    border-radius: 8px;
                    margin-bottom: 28px;
                  "
                >
                  <div
                    style="
                      font-size: 13px;
                      font-weight: 700;
                      color: #1e40af;
                      margin-bottom: 4px;
                    "
                  >
                    What happens next?
                  </div>
                  <div
                    style="
                      font-size: 13px;
                      color: #1e3a8a;
                      line-height: 20px;
                    "
                  >
                    1. Enter the OTP code on the verification screen.<br />
                    2. Setup your shop details, logo, and business bio.<br />
                    3. Connect your payout method and start listing products!
                  </div>
                </div>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 10px;
                    font-size: 13px;
                    line-height: 20px;
                    color: #64748b;
                  "
                >
                  If you did not initiate this merchant application, please ignore this email or reach out to our security team immediately.
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 25px 0 0;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    color: #334155;
                    font-weight: 500;
                  "
                >
                  Best regards,<br />
                  <strong style="color: #0f172a">The HashCart Merchant Team</strong>
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Footer -->
            <tr>
              <td
                align="center"
                style="
                  padding: 24px 30px;
                  background-color: #f1f5f9;
                  border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
                  font-size: 12px;
                  color: #64748b;
                  line-height: 18px;
                "
              >
                <div>
                  © 2026 <strong>HashCart Inc.</strong> All rights reserved.
                </div>
                <div style="margin-top: 6px">
                  This is an automated security email. Please do not reply directly to this message.
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
